
Question? Can I upload a html, css and javascript containing web project to directly to my wix website?
$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$

Answer: 
No, you cannot directly upload or import a traditional HTML/CSS/JavaScript web project folder into Wix. 

Wix relies on its own visual rendering engine and proprietary hosting structure. 
It does not support standard server-file hosting where you can drag and drop an index.html file alongside a stylesheet and a script file.

