1. Embed Code using an iFrame (Best for self-contained components)
You can embed your custom HTML, inline CSS, and JavaScript directly into a specific section of your page using the Embed HTML tool.

How to do it: Open the Wix Editor, click Add Elements (+), select Embed Code, and choose Embed HTML.

Limitation: 
The code runs in a sandboxed iframe. It cannot directly interact with the parent Wix page, its data collections, or other Wix elements.

