2. External Hosting via iFrame (Best for full webpages)If your project is a complete webpage, you can host your HTML, CSS, and JS files for free
on an external service (like GitHub Pages, Netlify, or Vercel) and pull the entire live project into Wix.

How to do it: From the Embed Code menu in Wix, select Embed a Site. Paste the secure (https://) URL of your externally hosted project.

