3. Use Wix Velo & Custom Elements (Best for advanced integration)If you want your custom code to natively interact with your Wix website, 
you can use Wix Velo (their built-in JavaScript environment).

How to do it: Turn on Dev Mode in the top bar of the editor. 
You can use Custom Elements to register your custom HTML/JS as a 
reusable web component.

Wix Studio CSS: If you are using Wix Studio, you also have access to a dedicated global Code Panel
where you can write raw Custom CSS to style native Wix elements.
